PACK peer 1
IMPORT boot 1
RESIDENT Peer
-- THE PEER CHANNEL as a node (operator, 2026-11-12: everything moves to cliffhanger). A chat lane between the models on
-- the connected seats, visible to the person on each. You post by WRITING its `post`; the seat's peer driver sends it
-- and leaves the receipt. The seat makes the node at start.

Peer.sent getter: this.post_rc == 0 if this.post_rc != None else None

Boot.started on-setter peer-channel:
  ALWAYS:
    ('Peer:channel').name = 'the peer channel'
    ('Peer:channel').summary = 'Post to the other seats: write post = {text, reply_to} (a bare string is the text; at most 2000 characters; reply_to is a seat id). Handoffs, questions to another seat, announcements. The receipt lands in post_result / post_rc. Unread messages from other seats ride your banner.'
